  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ID-TF PNPM Pro-Poor Planning, Budgeting and Monitoring Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to improve poverty targeting of local government expenditures and local government responsiveness to community needs through the scale-up and institutionalization of the Pro-poor Planning, Budgeting and Monitoring (P3BM) program.</narrative>
  </description>
